						 <blockquote> <p>ive seen pictures of zyn's hands before and the fingermarkings are obviously photoshopped. they must be a spy of the bug people!</p> </blockquote> <p>Incidentally, I actually have a scar through one of my fingerprints from an unfortunate run-in with a door in middle school. I don't think it shows in any of the pictures I've taken with butterflies on my hands, though.</p> <blockquote> <p>ive never seen a photogen. like that before, actually, and a lot of them live in my area. Albino genetics?</p> </blockquote> <p>Probably! I'm not sure what species of mantis it is. My friend who is more trained in bug-fu than I am (he picks up spiders with his bare hands) says that he thinks it's an albino of some sort.</p> 
				 	]]>
