					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-398371#post-2708967</guid>
				<title>Staff Post - Open</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-398371/scp-006-j#post-2708967</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 14 Dec 2016 01:42:43 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Jacob Conwell</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1372582</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Timer Expired. Edits made as discussed below. Author may revert at any time.</p> <p>The WikiWalk team is proposing edits to this page. All proposed edits will be in a collapsible below this post, and after 7 days if there are no serious objections to the edits, the feedback received will be taken into account as the edits are made. If you have questions not directly related to the article about this project, please pm a member of the <a href="http://05command.wikidot.com/wikiwalk-main">WikiWalk Team</a></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;Block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Proposing edits for joke articles, especially one as brief as this is tricky business. You really don't want to mess with the jokes by adding additional paragraphs to justify a crosslink, so generally I try to stick with in-line links. This article, as it so happens, has a pretty decent counter part in <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-006-cu-ex">SCP-006-CU-EX</a> in which the joke is inverted, and as such would make sense to crosslink to. As such, I'm recommending the following edit:</p> <p>Changing the following:</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Addendum 006-J:</strong> <em>Guys, it isn't even that big, okay? Look, I'm going up to it and it hasn't attacked me yet.</em> - Dr. ████████</p> </blockquote> <p>To this:</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Addendum 006-J:</strong> <em><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-006-cu-ex">Guys, it isn't even that big, okay?</a> Look, I'm going up to it and it hasn't attacked me yet.</em> - Dr. ████████</p> </blockquote> <p>If anyone has other/better examples that could be used here please leave a comment saying so!</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-398371#post-2687848</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-398371/scp-006-j#post-2687848</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 09 Nov 2016 02:52:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>MudLord</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2866018</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I think I found one of these fuckers in my house. I barely came out alive.</p> <p>So I was just bein' me, cool as always, hittin' chicks. Then when I go to bed, I see this little dot on the other side of my room. When I get closer, I realize it's a spider. So the spider looks at me and says &quot;Yo you got da blew stuff?&quot; I reply&quot;Uh&#8230;no?&quot; Then out of nowhere, this fucker pulls out a MINI SHOTGUN and then like, a hundred other of these little guys wearin' hoods, bandannas, and flat-billed hats come outta NOWHERE, and start shooting me.</p> <p>Let's just say, thank the lord for fly swatters and 12-gauge shotguns.</p> <p>Now I have to pay $5'000 for floor damage. :[</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
